    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Romel,\n\nFollowing the intake-to-document example I sent, I wanted to share a short article on the organizational side of AI.\n\nA tool can handle its part well while the next step still depends on someone's memory. Making ownership and human review clear is just as important as the technology. That's guiding our work at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/nspin7u0QA\n\nFrom your managing partner's perspective at RA & Associates, which needs more attention: the tools or the way responsibilities are shared? I'd value your view.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: where AI could compound at RA & Associates, APC",
